      "failure_scenario": "Guard helpers already over the per-function ceiling keep growing (crux_serve_routes.rows 20->24, sweep 12->16), so each new serve row lands in a function too branchy to mutation-test row by row.",
      "precision_class": "advisory",
      "rationale_for_class": "All four are Python guard helpers, not shipped code; the ceiling is a ratchet signal, not a merge block."
     }
